  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian action through volunteers, enablers and networks (HAVEN) in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Working with a consortium led by Nonviolent Peaceforce International (NP) to support frontline volunteer groups, promote International Humanitarian Law and norms, pilot and run area-based coordination mechanisms and support humanitarian data collection to facilitate an effective humanitarian response in Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
